      <VERS vnumber="25"> The <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>will <gr str="5255">destroy </gr>the <gr str="1004">house </gr>of the <gr str="1343">proud</gr>: but he will <gr str="5324">establish </gr>the <gr str="1366">border </gr>of the <gr str="490">widow</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="26"> The <gr str="4284">thoughts </gr>of the <gr str="7451">wicked </gr>
